Package: ccamlrcat
Title: A Catalogue of CCAMLR Spatial Data as Cloud-Ready Recipes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Michael", "Sumner", , "mdsumner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Lists the public layers of the CCAMLR GIS (gis.ccamlr.org) and
    neighbouring sources (GEBCO, sea ice) as GDAL data source names, and
    reads them as 'sf' and 'terra' objects ready to draw with 'aobview'.
    A harvest script snapshots the CCAMLR layers to GeoParquet and Cloud
    Optimized GeoTIFF. This is an early prototype; the name is a
    placeholder.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Imports:
    utils
Suggests:
    aobview,
    sf,
    terra,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Remotes:
    allboa/aobview
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
URL: https://github.com/allboa/ccamlrcat
